                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "V3JQq",
                          "name": "T",
                          "fill": "$muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "a, anchor positions after the anchor phase, TNFRSF8 locus, GM12878, CTCF and RNAPII loops. b, the full chain of the same structure, black dots are anchors. c, three structures of the ensemble superposed on the first.",
